1Ki 14:1 , Abijah being sick, Jeroboam sends his wife, disguised, with presents to the prophet Ahijah at Shiloh;
1Ki 14:5 , Ahijah, forewarned by God, denounces God's judgment;
1Ki 14:17 , Abijah dies, and is buried;
1Ki 14:19 , Nadab succeeds Jeroboam;
1Ki 14:21 , Rehoboam's wicked reign;
1Ki 14:25 , Shishak spoils Jerusalem;
1Ki 14:29 , Abijam succeeds Rehoboam.
